						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#509">Kael Raid Update!!</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							Midnight Council of Fate has invited us to join in on a Kael raid Sunday June 30th.<br />
<br />
The raid time has been changed to 3pm EST (Noon PST)<br />
<br />
Raid level is now 43+ so i know i should see many of you there! Reply to Galanons posting on the message board if you wish to attend.<br />
We will all be meeting on the EW side of Kael.<br />
<br />
An honorable gesture by their clan, be sure to give them a /salute if you see any MCoF around!
						</td>
					</tr>
