						<td class="body">
							As you all have noticed, we are gaining great members to the family, and we are on our way to becoming a great clan, but remember it takes ALL of us to do so, and remember where the heart is, and uphold the name of the family, for we all are a part of it.  I would like to show my appreciation to our officers, who have been putting in a lot of time and effort in attaining these great members, and we strive to grow in importance.  As we grow we will be able to overcome to terrors in the world, and maybe someday defeat these bad Gods out there who do not appreciate us. (lol)  honor is important to us, and do good to others in the family and to the society.  People are watching even though u may not know it.  Thanks all for your efforts.  Good hunting!
